# API Keys Configuration
# This file documents the API keys used in this project

## Gemini AI API Key
Environment Variable: GEMINI_API_KEY
Purpose: Used for AI-powered features including:
- Chat responses and educational assistance
- Document topic extraction and analysis
- Question generation for study materials
- Daily challenge creation

Service: Google AI Studio (Gemini API)
Website: https://aistudio.google.com/
Model Used: gemini-1.5-flash

